window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"kled","b":"locke","win":["Kled","Kled","Kled","Kled","Kled","Kled","Kled"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Bear Trap pull plus Skaarl's extra health bar makes the first trade yours — take it and set the tone for the lane."},{"when":"Levels 2-5 W trades","text":"Violent Tendencies windows plus two health bars mean every short trade profits — trade on cooldown."},{"when":"Locke 6 + first item","text":"His execute window — and your remount eats it. Fight through Purgatory rather than fearing it."},{"text":"Two-plus items his execute stops scaling faster than your build — end every fight above the floor and focus him in the ten seconds after Ashen Pursuit (E) is spent.","when":"2+ items"}],"wants":{"you":["Trade on every W cooldown","Bait his execute with Skaarl's bar","Snowball a permanent lane lead"],"foe":["Poke Skaarl off before fighting","Land Purgatory on dismounted Kled","Escape the lane without feeding"]},"early":"Rare treat: you win every single stage of this. Level 1 Bear Trap plus Skaarl's second health bar bullies him outright, and Violent Tendencies trades at 2 through 5 come out ahead every time — your E dash even dodges the engage his level-3 dash tries to force. Trade on every cooldown and make the lane unlivable.","mid":"His one hope is the 6-plus-first-item execute window, and your kit is the direct counter: R and remount survive Purgatory and out-sustain his grey-health trades, while your first-item on-hit spike sits behind an HP pool his burst cannot clear. Keep fighting — the math stays yours.","late":"Nothing changes: two health bars and remount sustain win every late fight, so pressure the side lane and force him to answer you. Charge into picks, remount mid-fight, and remember the only Kled who loses this matchup is the one who stops playing like he is winning.","whys":["Your level-1 Q pull and Skaarl's second health bar bully him outright.","You control level 2 with Q range and W attack-speed trades.","Your W shred and E dash-dodge win the level-3 all-in — his new dash included.","Through 4-5 you out-trade him with the W steroid and two health bars.","Your level-6 R and remount survive his execute and out-sustain his grey-health W trades.","Your first-item on-hit spike walls his burst behind your HP pool.","Two health bars and remount sustain win every late fight."]});
