window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"kled","b":"masteryi","win":["Kled","Kled","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi","Kled"],"spikes":[{"when":"Levels 1-2","text":"Mounted trades with the pull and W resets bully him — chunk hard while his kit is still offline."},{"when":"Yi levels 4-6","text":"Wuju Style (14s) true damage feasts on dismounted Kled — interrupt Meditate with the Bear Trap yank or he heals it all back."},{"when":"Yi first item","text":"Highlander (85s) makes him immune to your Bear Trap slow — this is his kill window, play it with jungle cover."},{"when":"Your late game","text":"Remount cadence plus Bear Trap burst wins the scrap again — re-engage on every remount."}],"wants":{"you":["Cash in your mounted early levels","Never fight dismounted mid game","Re-engage on every late remount"],"foe":["Force dismounts and finish you","Snowball his 4-to-item window","Kill you before Skaarl returns"]},"early":"Open aggressive: mounted Bear Trap pulls and Violent Tendencies resets out-trade him badly at 1-2, so chunk him while his kit is offline. By 3 his Alpha resets start punishing your dismounted moments — keep courage high and stop trading the instant Skaarl leaves.","mid":"From level 4 through his first item the lane is genuinely his: Wuju true damage feasts on dismounted Kled, and Highlander shreds an HP pool with no resists behind it. Farm from range while dismounted, fight only from a full mount, and spend this stretch not dying rather than proving points.","late":"Late flips back to you: remounting mid-fight doubles the duel, and Bear Trap burst front-loads damage his sustain cannot match. Take the 1v1s again, force him to kill two health bars inside one Highlander, and re-engage the instant Skaarl answers the whistle.","whys":["Mounted, your Bear Trap pull dominates his level 1.","Your Violent Tendencies resets out-trade him at level 2.","By 3 it evens out — Alpha Strike goes untargetable straight through your Bear Trap.","Meditate heals off your chip while Wuju true damage burns you.","At 6 Highlander makes him immune to your trap slow — the window is his.","His first item plus Wuju Style true damage shreds your HP faster than you rebuild it.","Late, your remount and Bear Trap burst flip the duel back to you."]});
